          "start": 921
        },
        "quote": "(b) The Topeka Planning Commission shall have jurisdiction over all planning, zoning and platting matters which arise within the corporate boundaries of the City of Topeka and shall also have jurisdiction over all planning, zoning and platting matters which arise within three miles of the City’s corporate boundaries. (Ord. 20206 § 81, 9-10-19. Code 1981 § 33-32. Code 1995 § 110-39. Formerly 2.65.090.)",
